# Game Design

## Core Concept

The game is a local cooperative space shooter.

Two players work together against AI-controlled enemies.

The game is composed of multiple level types.

Each level type may define its own movement model, enemy behaviour, objectives, and victory conditions.

---

## Players

The game supports two simultaneous players.

Players cooperate and never compete.

Players can:

- move
- attack
- take damage
- be destroyed

The game ends when all players are destroyed.

---

## Progression

Gameplay progresses through levels.

Each level defines:

- enemy composition
- objectives
- completion conditions

Level transitions are managed by the Level Manager.

---

## Combat

Players attack enemies using projectiles.

Enemies may attack players using:

- collisions
- projectiles
- level-specific mechanics

Combat behaviour may vary between level types.

---

## Extensibility

New gameplay experiences should be introduced as new levels rather than modifying existing levels.

Examples:

- Survival Level
- Formation Level
- Boss Level
- Escort Level
- Asteroid Field Level